NorthPoleMechanicsTooltip:
    '''
    Successful swings grow a snowflake; full charge or two misses release it
    On impact it bursts into icicles
    Thrusts call snowflakes: collect them for speed, regeneration and critical damage
    Bracing grows a piercing icicle behind the enemy; running faster makes it larger
    Throws shed snowflakes; hits coat enemies in snow that inflicts Frostbite
    '''

